 * Journey chapter 7: Software Developer at crowd.inc (July 2021 – March 2024) and what the role
 * owned. The title is "Software Developer"; the home page's experience section has the same
 * facts as a résumé entry.
 *
 * The chapter opens with what crowd.inc was, in the owner's words: a website for sharing ideas
